    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Shea O'Toole are delighted to present this large plot of land, suitable for development of a residential dwelling, subject to planning permission. The total area extends to 0.22 hectares / 0.54 acres, with good road frontage. \n\nIt is situated in an attractive elevated rural setting with nice views over the surrounding countryside. It is convenient to Faithlegg, Faithlegg National School and access to Waterford City. \n\nFaithlegg - 2 km - 4 minutes' drive\n\nPassage East - 2.6 km - 4 minutes' drive\n\nCheekpoint - 3.3 km - 5 minutes' drive\n\nWaterford Hospital - 8 km - 12 minutes' drive\n\nWaterford city centre - 11 km - 22 minutes' drive\n\nDunmore East - 17 km - 18 minutes' drive\n\nAbove distances and drive times are approximate only. Source Google Maps.\n\nDrone images with red outline are for identification purposes only. \n\n \n\n"
      }
